        <div class="pane" id="paneElapsed" hidden>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">걸린 시간<span class="sp"></span><button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="elMask" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="eye-off" /><span>가리기</span></button></div>
            <div class="el-res maskable" id="elRes">
              <div class="big-val" id="elDur" aria-live="polite"></div>
              <div class="el-eq" id="elEq"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="hint-text" id="elNote"></p>
            <div class="row"><button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="elPlay" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="play" /><span>시작부터 돌려보기</span></button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">시작한 시각 옮기기</div>
            <div class="step-grid" data-for="a">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn h" data-add="-60">− 1시간</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="-10">− 10분</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="-1">− 1분</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn h" data-add="60">+ 1시간</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="10">+ 10분</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="1">+ 1분</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">끝난 시각 옮기기</div>
            <div class="step-grid" data-for="b">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn h" data-add="-60">− 1시간</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="-10">− 10분</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="-1">− 1분</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn h" data-add="60">+ 1시간</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="10">+ 10분</button><button type="button" class="sk-btn m" data-add="1">+ 1분</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="toggles" style="margin-bottom:12px">
            <button type="button" class="tog" id="elMinNums" aria-pressed="true">분 숫자</button>
            <button type="button" class="tog" id="elSnap5" aria-pressed="false">5분씩 끌기</button>
          </div>
          <p class="hint-text"><Icon name="lightbulb" /> 시간 띠의 한 칸은 10분이에요. 6칸이면 60분, 1시간이에요. 긴바늘이 한 바퀴 돌면 60분이 지나요.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 하루 -->
        <div class="pane" id="paneDay" hidden>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="ro-main" id="dayMain" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div class="ro-alt" id="dayAlt"></div>
            <div class="ro-sub" id="dayNote"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">하루 흘러가기 · 밤 12시부터 다음 날 밤 12시까지</div>
            <div class="row"><button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="dayPlay" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="play" /><span>하루 돌려보기</span></button></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="cap">빠르기</span><div class="seg sm" id="daySpeed" style="flex:1" role="group" aria-label="빠르기"><button type="button" data-v="30000">천천히</button><button type="button" data-v="16000">보통</button><button type="button" data-v="7000">빠르게</button></div></div>
            <div class="counter">
              <div class="h">짧은바늘<b id="cntH">0바퀴</b></div>
              <div class="m">긴바늘<b id="cntM">0바퀴</b></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="hint-text"><Icon name="lightbulb" /> <b>하루는 24시간</b>이에요. 오전은 밤 12시부터 낮 12시까지, 오후는 낮 12시부터 밤 12시까지예요. 아래 하루 띠를 눌러도 시각이 바뀌어요.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 일과 -->
        <div class="pane" id="paneRoutine" hidden>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">보는 방법</div>
            <div class="seg" id="rtView" role="group" aria-label="보는 방법"><button type="button" data-v="circle">원</button><button type="button" data-v="bar">막대</button><button type="button" data-v="both">함께 보기</button></div>
            <div class="row"><button type="button" class="tog" id="rtHide" aria-pressed="false" style="flex:1">활동 이름 가리기</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">나의 하루 일과 · 이름과 시각을 바꿔 보세요</div>
            <div class="rt-sum" id="rtSum"></div>
            <div class="rt-warn" id="rtWarn" hidden></div>
            <div class="rt-list" id="rtList"></div>
            <div class="row">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="rtAdd"><Icon name="plus" />활동 더하기</button>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="rtSample"><Icon name="rotate-ccw" />예시 일과</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="rtPrint"><Icon name="printer" />인쇄</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm sk-btn--danger" id="rtClear"><Icon name="trash-2" />모두 지우기</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="hint-text"><Icon name="lightbulb" /> 그림에서 활동을 누르면 손잡이가 나와요. 손잡이를 끌면 시작한 시각과 끝난 시각이 5분씩 바뀌어요.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 달력 -->
        <div class="pane" id="paneCal" hidden>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="seg" id="calMode" role="group" aria-label="달력 쓰는 방법"><button type="button" data-v="one">날짜 고르기</button><button type="button" data-v="range">두 날 사이 재기</button></div>
            <div class="cal-info" id="calInfo" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div class="step-grid" id="calMoves" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" data-mv="-7">1주일 전</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" data-mv="-1">하루 전</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" data-mv="1">하루 뒤</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" data-mv="7">1주일 뒤</button>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <select id="calYearSel" aria-label="연도 고르기" style="flex:1"></select>
              <select id="calMonthSel" aria-label="달 고르기" style="flex:1"></select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">고른 날에 표시하기</div>
            <div class="row">
              <input type="text" id="calMarkTxt" placeholder="예: 내 생일" maxlength="12" style="flex:1" aria-label="표시할 글">
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="calMarkAdd" style="flex:none">표시</button>
              <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="calMarkDel" style="flex:none">지우기</button>
            </div>
            <div class="row"><button type="button" class="tog" id="calHide" aria-pressed="false" style="flex:1">날짜 숫자 가리기 (누르면 보여요)</button></div>
          </div>
          <div class="group">
            <div class="group-title">달마다 날수 · <span id="calYearNote"></span></div>
            <div class="months" id="calMonths"></div>
            <p class="hint-text"><b>1주일은 7일</b>, <b>1년은 12개월</b>이에요. 같은 요일은 7일마다 돌아와요.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 미션 -->
        <div class="pane" id="paneMission" hidden>
          <div class="m-top">
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--sm" id="mExit"><Icon name="arrow-left" />자유 탐험으로</button>
          </div>
          <div class="sk-mnav" id="missionNav" aria-label="미션 번호"></div>
          <h3 class="m-title" id="mTitle"></h3>
          <div class="m-step" id="mStep" aria-label="문제 진행"></div>
          <p class="m-q" id="mQ"></p>
          <div id="mFeedback"></div>
          <div id="mAnswer"></div>
          <div class="m-actions sk-actions">
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="mCheck"><Icon name="circle-check" />확인하기</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="mNextQ" hidden><Icon name="arrow-right" />다음 문제</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="mNextMission" hidden><Icon name="arrow-right" />다음 미션</button>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn" id="mResult" hidden><Icon name="award" />결과 보기</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 결과 ============ -->
<div id="screenResult" class="screen result-screen sk-screen">
  <div class="result-trophy" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="trophy" /></div>
  <h1>미션 결과</h1>
  <p class="intro-sub" id="resultSub"></p>
  <div class="result-grid" id="resultGrid" role="list"></div>
  <div class="summary">
    <h3><Icon name="book-open" />배움 정리</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>긴바늘이 한 바퀴 돌면 <b>60분 = 1시간</b>이에요.</li>
      <li><b>하루는 24시간</b>이에요. 낮 12시 전은 오전, 낮 12시 뒤는 오후예요.</li>
      <li><b>1주일은 7일</b>, <b>1년은 12개월</b>이에요. 같은 요일은 7일마다 돌아와요.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="result-btns">
    <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--primary" id="btnRetry"><Icon name="rotate-ccw" />다시 하기</button>
    <button type="button" class="sk-btn" id="btnToFree"><Icon name="arrow-left" />자유 탐험으로</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 인쇄용(일과표) -->
<div id="printSheet" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<script is:inline src="/apps/time-class/app.js"></script>
</AppLayout>
